{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"86579810":{"pageid":86579810,"ns":6,"title":"File:John Martin's Christmas Pageant(GN14778).jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":950549,"width":2448,"height":3264,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/82/John_Martin%27s_Christmas_Pageant%28GN14778%29.jpg/1920px-John_Martin%27s_Christmas_Pageant%28GN14778%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1600,"thumbheight":2133,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/John_Martin%27s_Christmas_Pageant%28GN14778%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/82/John_Martin%27s_Christmas_Pageant%28GN14778%29.jpg/1920px-John_Martin%27s_Christmas_Pageant%28GN14778%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1600,"height":2133,"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/John_Martin%27s_Christmas_Pageant%28GN14778%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/John_Martin%27s_Christmas_Pageant%28GN14778%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:John_Martin%27s_Christmas_Pageant(GN14778).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/page/86579810","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2020-02-04 01:08:04","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"<div class=\"fn\">\nJohn Martin's Christmas Pageant</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"CC-Zero|Adelaide Christmas Pageant|Christmas in the 1940s|Uploaded by Htsa","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\nState Government Photographer</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<p>Crowds throughout Rundle Mall at the John Martin's Christmas Pageant c. 1950s. \n</p>\nAdelaide's Christmas Pageant was founded by Sir Edward Hayward and established in 1933. He was the owner of the Adelaide department store John Martin's, and was inspired by the Toronto Santa Claus Parade and Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade. Hayward opened the first 'Children's Christmas Parade' on 18 November 1933 at the height of the Great Depression. It was a success; running for around forty minutes with just eight floats and three bands, it attracted 200,000 spectators and from then the tradition of the John Martin's Christmas Pageant or as it was affectionately known the 'Johnnie's Christmas Pageant' was born. Father Christmas was introduced in 1934 and tradition of the pageant finishing at the Magic Cave (itself created in 1905) was established.</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"circa 1948<div style=\"display: none;\">date QS:P571,+1948-00-00T00:00:00Z/9,P1480,Q5727902</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"The History Trust of South Australian,  South Australian Government <br> Photo <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://data.history.sa.gov.au/sagpc/media/preview/15791?maxsize=1000\">[1]</a> <br> Object record <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://data.history.sa.gov.au/sagpc/getitem/15791\">[2]</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<table style=\"width:100%; clear:both; text-align:center; margin:0.5em auto; background-color:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle, #f8f9fa); border: 2px solid var(--border-color-subtle, #c8ccd1); padding: 0; border-spacing: 8px; color:var(--color-base, #202122);\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"layouttemplate licensetpl\" lang=\"en\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:90px;\" rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Creative Commons\"><img alt=\"Creative Commons\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Cc.logo.circle.svg/40px-Cc.logo.circle.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Cc.logo.circle.svg/60px-Cc.logo.circle.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\"></span></span>\u00a0<span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"CC-Zero\"><img alt=\"CC-Zero\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Cc-zero.svg/40px-Cc-zero.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Cc-zero.svg/60px-Cc-zero.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>This file is made available under the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Creative_Commons\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Creative Commons\">Creative Commons</a> <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"ccorg:publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en\">CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<td>The person who associated a work with this deed has dedicated the work to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:public_domain\" class